Z||000000||JetroGT||01-30-2000||04:15 PM||||<BR>I stoped over at my parents accross town and aksed my Dad if he wanted to go on an adventure. We went out to the garage, got a couple of wood saws and a hack saw. "At this point I still didn't tell him that I bought another fiero." He says, "Where are we going?" I just replied, "South side of town." We got to the storage place and all he said was, "Another Fiero?" I got out the wood saws and we began to cut the hood in half at the point where it was bowed up the most. I took a few pictures of this process. It wasen't very pretty. The front end damage wasnt too bad. all that's really bent is the metal before the first compartment. Like I said before, it runs and drives great. I just have to get everything working so I can get it retitled. <BR>So if any one need some blue piecies of fiberglass, I've got some.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||12
